#. content.xml (validation title)
msgid "Try formatting"
msgstr "尝试格式化功能"

#. content.xml (validation help message)
msgid "Explore the Format tab to customize your data with styles and formats."
msgstr "前往“格式”选项卡，通过自定义样式与格式美化您的数据。"

#. content.xml (validation title)
msgid "Help"
msgstr "帮助"

#. content.xml (validation help message)
msgid ""
"For Medium Stock use condition \"Values between: 20-80\" and style \"Medium "
"Stock\"."
msgstr "对于“中等库存”，请使用条件“介于 20 至 80 之间的值”以及样式“中等库存”。"

#. content.xml (validation title)
msgid "Use other options"
msgstr "使用其他选项"

#. content.xml (validation help message)
msgid ""
"Use Standard or Advanced Filter to narrow down your data more precisely"
msgstr "使用标准筛选或高级筛选更精准地缩小数据范围"

#. content.xml (validation title)
msgid "Share document link"
msgstr "共享文档链接"

#. content.xml (validation help message)
msgid ""
"Share a direct link with people who already have access to the document for "
"quick and easy access."
msgstr "直接与已获权限的人员共享文档链接，方便其快速访问。"

#. content.xml (sheet name)
msgid "👋 Introduction"
msgstr "👋 简介"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "<1>Next Chapter: ✚</1><2> Formulas & Functions</2>"
msgstr "<1>下一章：✚</1><2> 公式与函数</2>"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "👋General information"
msgstr "👋基本信息"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid ""
"Collabora Office spreadsheet can be used to calculate, analyse, and manage "
"your data. This introduction template will help you get started and explore "
"some of the main features of the product."
msgstr ""
"Collabora Office 电子表格可用于计算、分析和管理您的数据。此简介模板将帮助您快"
"速上手并了解产品的一些主要功能。"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "Calc features – key features you can explore"
msgstr "Calc 功能列表 – 您可以探索的核心功能"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "Calculations (Formulas & Functions)"
msgstr "计算（公式与函数）"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid ""
"Use built-in functions to perform calculations on your data. Create formulas"
" easily and get help with the Function Wizard."
msgstr "使用内置函数对数据进行计算。轻松创建公式，也可借助“函数向导”获取帮助。"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表格"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid ""
"Organise your data into structured tables. Quickly edit, sort, and filter "
"information to keep everything clear and easy to manage."
msgstr ""
"将数据整理为结构化表格。快速编辑、排序与筛选信息，让所有数据清晰直观、便于管"
"理。"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "Charts"
msgstr "图表"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid ""
"Visualise your data with different chart types. Quickly create and customise"
" charts to better understand trends and comparisons."
msgstr ""
"使用不同的图表类型实现数据可视化。快速创建并自定义图表，以更好地理解趋势或对"
"比。"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "Sorting & filtering"
msgstr "排序与筛选"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid ""
"Find what matters faster by sorting and filtering your data. Focus only on "
"the information you need."
msgstr ""
"通过对数据进行排序和筛选，更快找到重点内容。通过使用排序和筛选，您可以聚焦于"
"您需要的信息。"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "Data formatting"
msgstr "数据格式化"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid ""
"Format your data to improve clarity and readability. Use colours, styles, "
"and number formats to highlight key information."
msgstr "格式化数据以提高清晰度和可读性。使用颜色、样式和数字格式突出显示关键信息。"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "Collaboration tools"
msgstr "协作工具"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid ""
"Work together in real time. Share, comment, and track changes directly in "
"the document."
msgstr "支持实时多人协作，可直接在文档内进行共享、发表批注及追踪修改。"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "无障碍"

#. content.xml (sheet '👋 Introduction')
msgid ""
"Calc is designed with accessibility in mind, helping ensure that everyone "
"can easily create, edit, and work with spreadsheets."
msgstr ""
"Calc 在设计时充分考虑了无障碍辅助功能，确保每个人都能轻松创建、编辑和使用电子"
"表格。"

#. content.xml (sheet name)
msgid "✚ Formulas & Functions"
msgstr "✚ 公式与函数"

#. content.xml (sheet '✚ Formulas & Functions')
msgid "✚Using simple functions"
msgstr "✚使用简单函数"

#. content.xml (sheet '✚ Formulas & Functions')
msgid ""
"We will look at a practical case to learn how to use basic Calc features and"
" simple functions."
msgstr "我们将通过一个例子，学习如何使用 Calc 的基本功能和简单函数。"

#. content.xml (sheet '✚ Formulas & Functions')
msgid "Step-by-step guide – Adding values"
msgstr "分步指南 – 求和计算"

#. content.xml (sheet '✚ Formulas & Functions')
msgid ""
"In this example we want to calculate the total number of items in stock. The"
" SUM function allows you to quickly add numbers together."
msgstr "在本例中，我们想要计算库存物品的总数量。SUM 函数允许您快速将多个数值相加。"

#. content.xml (sheet '✚ Formulas & Functions')
msgid "Writing formula into cell"
msgstr "在单元格中写入公式"

#. content.xml (sheet '✚ Formulas & Functions'); content.xml (sheet '📋
